 # Coupled pilot
 
-Run the pilot using scripts/run_coupled_pilot.py. Case selection needs documenting.
+Run the pilot using `scripts/run_coupled_pilot.py`. To select specific cases, repeat
+`--case`; for example:
+
+```sh
+scripts/run_coupled_pilot.py --case alpha --case gamma
+```
+
+Repeated IDs are deduplicated. Selected cases still run in their original suite
+order, not the order of the flags. Unknown IDs are rejected before the output
+directory is created or any case executes. With no `--case` flags, the pilot
+runs every case in the suite.
